            "question": "Will Frood pouches keep me fuller for longer?",
            "answer": "<p>Frood pouches are made with a blend of plant-based ingredients including vegetables, fibres and, in some recipes, protein sources such as faba bean protein or wholegrain oats. These nutrients can help support satiety (feeling fuller for longer) as part of a balanced diet.</p><p>Frood recipes also provide a good source of fibre (typically around 12–17g per 100g in the dry blend), which can further contribute to a feeling of fullness.</p><p>As with all foods, how filling a meal is will depend on portion size and what you prepare it with.</p>"
